      "statement": "Taskfile.yml (Task v3) defines four tasks: setup:check (runs the check.mjs audit without changing the system), test (runs the browser-free builder scaffold and demo regression scripts), install:opencode (installs all skills globally for OpenCode via the npx skills command), and openwiki:update (runs openwiki --update).",
