      "statement": "The GitHub Actions workflow .github/workflows/test.yml documents the browser-free CI path: on every push and pull request a builder job runs on ubuntu-latest with Node 22, executing the scaffold test and then building a fixture in a fresh temporary directory and running its format:check, typecheck, and test commands, never installing the Chrome extension or attaching to a browser.",
